<title>VENEZUELA: Sudamtex Q1 share rises.</title>
<headline>Sudamtex Q1 share rises.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales 16.8 bln bolivars vs 15.5 bln</p>
<p>Cost of sales 13.8 bln bolivars vs 13.2 bln</p>
<p>Operating profit 1.2 bln bolivars vs 724 million</p>
<p>Net profit 2.8 bln bolivars vs 2.6 bln</p>
<p>Earnings per share 3.56 bolivars vs 3.27</p>
<p>NOTES: Results are expressed in constant September 30, 1996 bolivars, and are consolidated.</p>
<p>Period ends September 30.</p>
<p>Sudamtex de Venezuela CA is a textile and fibre-glass manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
